# What never goes into the image.
#
# Two reasons, and the second one matters more than it looks: build leftovers from a
# Windows machine would be copied into a Linux image and confuse the build there, giving
# errors that make no sense because they are about a build that already happened
# somewhere else.

# Build leftovers
**/bin/
**/obj/
Frontend/node_modules/
Frontend/dist/

# Version control and editor
.git/
.gitignore
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# Logs and local scratch
**/logs/
*.log

# Nothing here runs in the image
deploy/
docs/
**/*.md
**/*.ps1

# Secrets never belong in an image. They are given to it when it runs.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
**/.env
